  "prefLabel": "En 409.01 Form T-9 Withdrawal of Authorization to Operate As a Telephone Utility In New Hampshire",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 409.01 Form T-9 Withdrawal of Authorization to Operate As a Telephone Utility In New Hampshire. An ELEC may request that the department consider its withdrawal of authorization to operate as an ELEC by completing and filing Form T-9 “Withdrawal of Authorization to Operate as a Telephone Utility in New Hampshire” dated 10/2025.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400); ss by #14417 (EXRF), eff 10-29-25, EXPIRES: 10-29-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en400.html"
